== S1 the dual memberships (R1)
PASS A2.1  [identity] ipW(A, cnot B) = ipW(cnot A, B) for symbolic tables (cnot is self-adjoint for ipW)
PASS A2.2  [witness] T_psi = diag(1) + P13 and cnot T_psi = diag(1) + O_c with O_c a signed permutation (no unit row/column) -- O_c = [[0, 0, -1], [0, -1, 0], [1, 0, 0]]
PASS A2.3  [identity] R1: E = T_psi/4 lies in dualW K_gen (both generator families, exact SOS identity)
PASS A2.4  [identity] R1: F = E00/2 - T_psi/4 lies in dualW K_gen (both generator families, exact SOS identity)
NOTE [written] A2.W1  -- K_gen is the convex cone generated by the two families prodState x y and cnot(prodState x y), x, y in the ball, so a table nonnegative on both families is nonnegative on K_gen; by A2.1 ipW(G, cnot g) = ipW(cnot G, g). Each SOS expression is >= 0 on the ball because |x|, |y| <= 1.

== S2 T_psi is outside K_gen; IE1 fails for K_gen (R2, R3)
PASS A2.5  [witness] R2: ipW(F, T_psi) < 0, so T_psi is not in K_gen -- value -1/2
PASS A2.6  [witness] R3: phiW = cnot(prodState xplus z3) (phiW in K_gen); R_H is a rotation; T_psi = actT R_H phiW
PASS A2.7  [witness] pauliW T_psi = psi psi^dagger, psi = (1, 1, 1, -1)/2 (T_psi is a pure state of Q3, landed M_cl.7)
NOTE [written] A2.W2  -- so actT R_H maps phiW in K_gen to T_psi outside K_gen: IE1 fails for K_gen; and K_gen is not Q3. This is a PSD-free certificate of the landed M_cl.9W conclusion (T_psi is not in SEP + cnot SEP): a linear witness F with exact SOS certificates in place of pure-state extremality.

