PASS A2.8  [identity] fourVal X Y E F = ipW E (X F Y^T) for symbolic tables (landed probe H8, re-checked)
PASS A2.9  [witness] R4: famI at (X, Y, E, F) = (phiW, phiW, T_psi/4, E00/2 - T_psi/4) is negative -- value -1/8
NOTE [written] A2.W3  -- phiW lies in K_gen (A2.6) and E, F lie in dualW K_gen (A2.3, A2.4), so FourCopyCoherent fails for the uniform family (K_gen, K_gen, K_gen, K_gen). K_gen contains the products, lies in maxCone (landed prodState_mem_maxCone, cnot_prodState_mem_maxCone) and is a convex cone, so by Lemma B1 (fourCopyCoherent_of_kt4Core, design run, [D]) no carrier carries KT4Core for it: H fails.
